# This directory holds sample .xlsx files used as test fixtures.
#
# Files here are created in two ways:
#   1. Programmatically in conftest.py using openpyxl (preferred — no binary files in Git).
#   2. Manually for edge cases that are hard to reproduce programmatically.
#
# Programmatically created fixtures are always preferred because:
#   - They document exactly what structure the test depends on.
#   - They do not bloat the Git repository with binary files.
#   - They can be inspected and modified without opening Excel.
